author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nThis issue occurred after updating my Godot from 4.3 to v4.4.stable.steam [4c311cbee] and migrating the v4.3 project to v4.4\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.stable (4c311cbee) - Windows 11 (build 22631) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Mobile) - integrated AMD Radeon(TM) Graphics (Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.; 31.0.12046.15003) - AMD Ryzen 5 5500U with Radeon Graphics (12 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe JSON.parse_string function now automatically parses integers as floating-point numbers during testing. The simplest example: the code print(JSON.parse_string(JSON.stringify({a: 1}))) outputs {a: 1.0} instead of the expected {a: 1}. This data type error causes numbers parsed from JSON to fail as dictionary indexes (where keys are all integer types and cannot match floating-point numbers), leading to partial functional abnormalities and display issues in my software.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nThis issue occurs whenever using the JSON.parse_string function—integer values without decimal points are parsed as floating-point numbers.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nvar test = {\"no\": 10}\nprint(JSON.parse_string(JSON.stringify(test)))\nPlacing this code in any node's _ready() function will reveal the error during runtime.","closed_by":{"login":"61130888","id":69079550,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5MDc5NTUw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69079550?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/61130888","html_url":"https://github.com/61130888","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/61130888/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/61130888/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/61130888/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/61130888/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/61130888/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/61130888/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/61130888/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/61130888/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/61130888/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103801/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103801/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}